      "content": "uhm i just dont have the time/money for a doctor right now. it doesnt look that bad, it's just a red circle. if i take some ibuprofen for the soreness and keep putting the clotrimazole on it twice a day, that should eventually clear it up right? it's probably just a fungus that's acting up.",
